## Data Source

Static content from `@/constants/recognition`: `CASE_ROLES` (role, description, caseName, example, translation, articles) and `CASE_TRIGGERS` (pattern, caseName, meaning, examples). Examples are shaped `{ greek, marked }`, where `marked` is a string or string array rendered by `MarkedGreek`. Role colour comes from `CASE_SCHEME` / `CASE_KEY` in `@/constants/grammar-palette`.

## Verification

- [x] greek-first: Greek examples prominent, English explains
- [x] function-first-labels: Doer / Target / Owner lead, grammar term is the badge
- [x] colour-honesty: only the marked words carry case colour
- [x] concept-order: Cases taught before pronouns (dependency respected)
- [x] decision-guides: trigger words decide the case when writing
